---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConsultForm from '../components/ConsultForm.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Payments & LC — Exporta Global" description="Secure your payments with the right terms — letters of credit, advance payment, and escrow guidance — so you get paid, in full, on time.">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; <a href="/#services">Services</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Payments & LC</div>
    <span class="pill">Payments & LC</span>
    <div class="ic-lg"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:52px;height:52px;color:var(--accent-2)"><rect x="1" y="4" width="22" height="16" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="1" y1="10" x2="23" y2="10"/></svg></div>
    <h1>Payments & LC</h1>
    <p class="sub">Secure your payments with the right terms — letters of credit, advance payment, and escrow guidance — so you get paid, in full, on time.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#consult" class="btn btn-accent">Get a Free Consultation →</a>
      <a href="#how" class="btn btn-ghost">How it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="prose reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Overview</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Get paid — reliably and in full.</h2>
      <p>Many exporters ship successfully but lose money at the payment stage: wrong terms, unsecured deals, or buyers who delay or default.</p><p>We help you choose and structure the right payment method for each buyer and deal, and guide you through letters of credit so your cash is protected.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="checklist" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Letter-of-credit setup & review</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Advance & deposit structuring</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Escrow guidance</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Buyer & country risk assessment</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Payment-term negotiation</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>On-time collection processes</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">What's included</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Everything in this service</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="3" y1="9" x2="21" y2="9"/><line x1="9" y1="21" x2="9" y2="9"/></svg></div><h3>Letters of credit</h3><p>Structure and review LCs so they actually protect you.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="1" y="4" width="22" height="16" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="1" y1="10" x2="23" y2="10"/></svg></div><h3>Advance & deposit terms</h3><p>Smart deposit structures that reduce your risk.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"/></svg></div><h3>Escrow guidance</h3><p>When and how to use escrow for safer deals.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg></div><h3>Risk assessment</h3><p>Evaluate buyer and country payment risk before you ship.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><line x1="23" y1="11" x2="17" y2="11"/></svg></div><h3>Term negotiation</h3><p>Help negotiating terms that work for both sides.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg></div><h3>On-time collection</h3><p>Processes to ensure payments land when they should.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2 class="h2">A clear, proven process</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Assess</h3><p>We evaluate the buyer, country, and deal risk.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">2</div><h3>Structure</h3><p>We recommend the right payment method and terms.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Document</h3><p>We help set up LCs or contracts correctly.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">4</div><h3>Collect</h3><p>You get paid, securely and on schedule.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Common questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Is a letter of credit always the best option?</h4><p>Not always — for trusted buyers, advance or deposit terms can be simpler. We recommend the right tool per deal.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Can you review an LC I already have?</h4><p>Yes. We check existing letters of credit for terms that could leave you exposed.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>What if a buyer refuses secure terms?</h4><p>We help you assess the risk and negotiate — and advise when a deal isn't worth the exposure.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<ConsultForm serviceHighlight="payments & lc" selectedService="Payments & LC" />
</BaseLayout>
